units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20
create_box 2 projectile
create_atoms 1 region projectile
region target block 0 20 0 20 22 62
create_atoms 1 region target
displace_atoms target move 0 0 22
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 10000
unfix 1
velocity projectile set 0 0 2000 units box
fix 2 all nve
run 20000
